{"id":"myagko","lemma":"мягко","pos":"adv","rank":3228,"glosses":["softly, mildly, gently"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/66/Ru-%D0%BC%D1%8F%D0%B3%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D1%8F%D0%B3%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это очень мягко.","en":"This is very bland.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Это глупо, мягко говоря.","en":"This is stupid, to say the least.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"foolishly, stupidly"},null,null]},{"text":"Он мягко подтолкнул меня.","en":"He pushed me gently.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,null,{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Я был, мягко говоря, удивлён.","en":"I was surprised, to say the least.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Это ещё мягко сказано.","en":"That's an understatement.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"still / more"},null,null]}]}